# with a constant secret. Measured without printing it: 26 characters, six lowercase words joined by hyphens, starting
# `test-` — a synthetic test value, not a credential. It is the ONLY hit of the full history (every ref) under this rule
# set; a push to a new or empty remote scans that history from the root and blocked on it permanently.
